# Node: the only proxy outbound, the local SOCKS5 that sing-box listens on at
# 127.0.0.1:2080.
#
# dae only does eBPF interception plus the direct/proxy decision. The node pool,
# latency tests and failover all live in sing-box, which refreshes them from
# Sub-Store on every start (see sing-box.service ExecStartPre). The old A/B pair
# (socks5 2080 for the host, 2081 for the LAN) is merged into this one.
node {
    'socks5://127.0.0.1:2080'
}
